    "name": "Imagine Lifetimes",
    "steam_appid": 1229570,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1229570/extras/33279c9b93d8490f44f655a2c265c5a5.avif?t=1731068680\" /></div><br><br>This is a satirical point-and-click &quot;simulation&quot; game about the meaning of life. Born with the ability to &quot;choose&quot;, your decisions shape the paths ahead of you. Face the inevitable through a series of &quot;life-changing&quot; predicaments as you make your way towards the end...<br><br><strong>FEATURES</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Explore a variety of meaningless choices, paths and (20+) increasingly morbid endings<br></li><li> Choose wisely, every choice has the potential to affect (end) your lifetime<br></li><li> Question the absurdity of existence as you figure out what it means to be alive...</li></ul><br><strong>WARNING:</strong> May contain traces of irony, nihilism and dark humor<br><strong>NOTE:</strong> This is a short (0.5-3 hour) game created by a solo developer<br> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1229570/extras/1b47e3e515e37d7b9f1151f8602e01f0.avif?t=1731068680\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1229570/extras/33279c9b93d8490f44f655a2c265c5a5.avif?t=1731068680\" /></div><br><br>This is a satirical point-and-click &quot;simulation&quot; game about the meaning of life. Born with the ability to &quot;choose&quot;, your decisions shape the paths ahead of you. Face the inevitable through a series of &quot;life-changing&quot; predicaments as you make your way towards the end...<br><br><strong>FEATURES</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Explore a variety of meaningless choices, paths and (20+) increasingly morbid endings<br></li><li> Choose wisely, every choice has the potential to affect (end) your lifetime<br></li><li> Question the absurdity of existence as you figure out what it means to be alive...</li></ul><br><strong>WARNING:</strong> May contain traces of irony, nihilism and dark humor<br><strong>NOTE:</strong> This is a short (0.5-3 hour) game created by a solo developer<br> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1229570/extras/1b47e3e515e37d7b9f1151f8602e01f0.avif?t=1731068680\" /></div>",
